-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §20 עובדי הוראה בתפקידים פארא-רפואיים: a
-- teaching employee in a paramedical role works an integrating teacher's
-- week (§19).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-19`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the section gives
-- these teachers the week another section of the agreement sets (§§15, 17 or
-- 18) and changes none of its hours; it adds no hour the law counts, and the
-- week is weighed, where it is on the law's subject, in that section's file.

§ `20 עובדי הוראה בתפקידים פארא-רפואיים`

@ref akn:art_20
GIVEN stage IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a paramedical teaching employee's full week` stage IS
    `an integrating teacher's full week` stage

#ASSERT `a paramedical teaching employee's full week` `a primary school` EQUALS `a week of` 26 3 7
